Package: parla-server
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Linzn <niklas.linz@mirranet.de>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: @DEPENDS@, adduser
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/LinzN/parla
Description: Backend server for the Parla language learning app
 Accounts, course delivery and progress sync for the Parla Android
 app (English and French for German speakers). Course files are reloaded
 automatically when they change, so new lessons reach the app without an
 app update.
 .
 Runs as the systemd service "parla" on 127.0.0.1:8085; put a TLS
 reverse proxy in front of it. Data lives in /var/lib/parla.
